<Project>

  <!-- The fixtures the gate's self-tests run (scripts/tests/test-host-crash.test.sh) are built exactly as a
       real suite under tests/ is — the same test SDK, xUnit v3 adapter and RaskTestResults wiring — or they
       would prove the gate against a configuration no suite has. They live here, outside tests/ and every
       solution, so no gate, scoper or `dotnet test Rask.slnx` ever discovers a test written to fail. -->
  <Import Project="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)../../../tests/Directory.Build.props" />

</Project>
